sical experience. Happy Playing Gamelan!\n\nKey feature:\n- Responsive and realistic sounds\n- Futuristic environment stage\n- Unable to play multiplayer in the future\"", "short_description": "\"Want to learn gamelan but you don't have an instrument? Now you can practice gamelan by playing an instrument virtually on your VR set."}]}, "developer_name": "ARUTALA", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.arutala.id/privacy/jogja-gamelan-virtual/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ARUTALA", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.arutala.id/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ART_CREATIVITY", "MUSIC", "SIMULATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "3167820463500224"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 0, "nodes": []}, "baseline_offer": null, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": []}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "4341287625948484", "version": "0.1.5"}, "id": "2003566683128514", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4203893463021235", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "4341287625948484"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"